        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Future AI advancements will make distinguishing humans from bots increasingly difficult.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "AI-generated voices can mimic a child’s voice accurately enough to deceive parents.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
